        "https://www.skoda-storyboard.com/en/skoda-model/elroq/"
      ],
      "description": "Škoda model page (skoda_model CPT, Media Room side). Full-bleed hero (model image + 'Models' chip + model-name h1 overlay) -> 9-anchor in-page icon nav -> Model Description rich text -> Key Facts (Highlights) cards -> Technical Data spec table -> 6 index-driven rails (Bodywork/Derivatives + News/Press Kits/Stories/Images/Videos 'Based on tags: <model>'). Spec: docs/ui-specs/template-model-page.md; content model T3 (SKODA-TEMPLATE-CONTENT-MODELS.md); ticket SKODA-208.",
